    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Jason Vergnano",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117849277461888316203/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIcu1ppNBlTiu4jHn9dSI5IHb2u1U7CkqEZrHr1T8sf8hdEcQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Great service. I've been going there exclusively for years and won't go anywhere else. Super honest, which is refreshing after dealing with the bandits at the big box stores.",
        "time": 1756643592,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Lulu Ye",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111315034783430199251/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVwo-hY5YdoOOk8m3z6BU17PgkbEDSkKJ7CozlroildG2xKodYH=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "We love maître piscine, the owner Gilbert and Linda treat you like family. They have the best service and price in town, they are always patient and friendly, they will take their time to explain everything you need to know. I prefer maître piscine than Club piscine, because you feel like home and they really take care of you! Also the service is always good! We love our pool and your hospitality! Thank you so much Gilbert and Linda 😊",
        "time": 1655054665,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Susan Dornan-Boulé",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105208758183830700769/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWPcpqrboejX-vp2tZuAqzeLnJEgBU2ssPkVbF6og0Ag1A1SQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "UPDATE: Had an issue with our 2nd hot tub we bought from the originsl owners. There are new owners and after several tries to repair from their subcontracted service it was finally fixed 9 months later. After having to drain our hot tub each time to attempt to repair I went through months worth of chemicals as they basically were thrown out wmeach time the hot tub had to be repaired.  Finally after several attempts the problem was found but part unavailable and then it was too cold to repair, so we had to wait until it got warmer.  So finally repaired and the new owner provided a replacement chemical kit free of charge to replace what was wasted with the draining to repair each time.  He really wants to make sure he's customers are satisfied and after speaking with him it truly shows. Because of this I give them a 5 star rating! Bravo for stepping up and making things right.\n\nExcellent service  you won't find better customer service from before, during and after than you get from Linda and Gilbert. We bought a hot tub from them when they first opened and returned today (10 years later)  to purchase a new one for our new house.",
        "time": 1757196924,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Anthony Barile",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107609109579498398978/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKqBAyl0b13mO4aIKLeQXgcZomPsKOyTqQPDW02R4mLUrcHgQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "The entire process was fantastic. When we went in to see about a 15' pool, they took the time to explain how everything works, differences in the equipment and even showed us a presentation on the install process. They did not try to upsell and made sure that we were happy with our purchase. The installation team was great. Once the pool was filled, I started the system and noticed there may be an issued. Called the installer and he came back same day and fixed the minor issue. They gave me a course on how everything works when I brought the water to be analyzed and will show me how to close and open the pool when the time comes. Great service. Great team. Thank you!!!",
        "time": 1723220352,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "evan King",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111196159551833349378/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXxMdF0mtfjJpWToaRzf_yL_KlNsUVFsIShOFmKgL3VJGoA6o0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I purchased a Thanos salt generating system. I asked them for their help to install the unit. Their response to support me technically was also offered although I relied on their expertise to install the unit for me. Alex came to take care of everything. I found his work ethic meticulous, and outstanding to detail. I couldn't be more than satisfied with the whole transaction from start to finish. What a wonderful experience. So grateful. I wish them all the success!",
        "time": 1717180388,
        "translated": false
      }
